{"s":63,"v":[{"t":"When the hypocrites come to you, [O Muḥammad], they say, \"We testify that you are the Messenger of Allāh.\" And Allāh knows that you are His Messenger, and Allāh testifies that the hypocrites are liars.","w":[["إِذَا","When","idhā",""],["جَآءَكَ","come to you","jāaka","",[["جَآءَ",57],["كَ",18]]],["ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقُونَ","the hypocrites","l-munāfiqūna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مُنَـٰفِقُونَ",413]]],["قَالُوا۟","they say","qālū","",[["قَالُ",16],["وا۟",3]]],["نَشْهَدُ","We testify","nashhadu",""],["إِنَّكَ","that you","innaka","",[["إِنَّ",15],["كَ",18]]],["لَرَسُولُ","(are) surely (the) Messenger","larasūlu","",[["لَ",23],["رَسُولُ",47]]],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah","l-lahi","ۗ"],["وَٱللَّهُ","And Allah","wal-lahu","",[["وَ",1],["ٱللَّهُ",9]]],["يَعْلَمُ","knows","yaʿlamu",""],["إِنَّكَ","that you","innaka","",[["إِنَّ",15],["كَ",18]]],["لَرَسُولُهُۥ","(are) surely His Messenger","larasūluhu","",[["لَ",23],["رَسُولُ",47],["هُۥ",5]]],["وَٱللَّهُ","and Allah","wal-lahu","",[["وَ",1],["ٱللَّهُ",9]]],["يَشْهَدُ","testifies","yashhadu",""],["إِنَّ","that","inna",""],["ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ","the hypocrites","l-munāfiqīna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مُنَـٰفِقِينَ",413]]],["لَكَـٰذِبُونَ","(are) surely liars","lakādhibūna","",[["لَ",23],["كَـٰذِبُونَ",365]]]]},{"t":"They have taken their oaths as a cover, so they averted [people] from the way of Allāh. Indeed, it was evil that they were doing.","w":[["ٱتَّخَذُوٓا۟","They take","ittakhadhū","",[["ٱتَّخَذُ",114],["وٓا۟",3]]],["أَيْمَـٰنَهُمْ","their oaths","aymānahum","",[["أَيْمَـٰنَ",193],["هُمْ",3]]],["جُنَّةًۭ","(as) a cover","junnatan",""],["فَصَدُّوا۟","so they turn away","faṣaddū","",[["فَ",7],["صَدُّ",328],["وا۟",3]]],["عَن","from","ʿan",""],["سَبِيلِ","(the) Way","sabīli",""],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah","l-lahi","ۚ"],["إِنَّهُمْ","Indeed, [they]","innahum","",[["إِنَّ",15],["هُمْ",3]]],["سَآءَ","evil is","sāa",""],["مَا","what","mā",""],["كَانُوا۟","they used to","kānū","",[["كَانُ",21],["وا۟",3]]],["يَعْمَلُونَ","do","yaʿmalūna","",[["يَعْمَلُ",58],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"That is because they believed, and then they disbelieved; so their hearts were sealed over, and they do not understand.","w":[["ذَٰلِكَ","That","dhālika","",[["ذَٰ",32],["لِ",0],["كَ",0]]],["بِأَنَّهُمْ","(is) because","bi-annahum","",[["بِ",10],["أَنَّ",41],["هُمْ",3]]],["ءَامَنُوا۟","they believed","āmanū","",[["ءَامَنُ",30],["وا۟",3]]],["ثُمَّ","then","thumma",""],["كَفَرُوا۟","they disbelieved","kafarū","",[["كَفَرُ",53],["وا۟",3]]],["فَطُبِعَ","so were sealed","faṭubiʿa","",[["فَ",7],["طُبِعَ",771]]],["عَلَىٰ","[upon]","ʿalā",""],["قُلُوبِهِمْ","their hearts","qulūbihim","",[["قُلُوبِ",104],["هِمْ",3]]],["فَهُمْ","so they","fahum","",[["فَ",7],["هُمْ",3]]],["لَا","(do) not","lā",""],["يَفْقَهُونَ","understand","yafqahūna","",[["يَفْقَهُ",532],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"And when you see them, their forms please you, and if they speak, you listen to their speech. [They are] as if they were pieces of wood propped up - they think that every shout is against them. They are the enemy, so beware of them. May Allāh destroy them; how are they deluded?","w":[["وَإِذَا","And when","wa-idhā","",[["وَ",1],["إِذَا",36]]],["رَأَيْتَهُمْ","you see them","ra-aytahum","",[["رَأَيْ",60],["تَ",18],["هُمْ",3]]],["تُعْجِبُكَ","pleases you","tuʿ'jibuka","",[["تُعْجِبُ",752],["كَ",18]]],["أَجْسَامُهُمْ","their bodies","ajsāmuhum","ۖ",[["أَجْسَامُ",2304],["هُمْ",3]]],["وَإِن","and if","wa-in","",[["وَ",1],["إِن",27]]],["يَقُولُوا۟","they speak","yaqūlū","",[["يَقُولُ",16],["وا۟",3]]],["تَسْمَعْ","you listen","tasmaʿ",""],["لِقَوْلِهِمْ","to their speech","liqawlihim","ۖ",[["لِ",8],["قَوْلِ",137],["هِمْ",3]]],["كَأَنَّهُمْ","as if they (were)","ka-annahum","",[["كَأَنَّ",372],["هُمْ",3]]],["خُشُبٌۭ","pieces of wood","khushubun",""],["مُّسَنَّدَةٌۭ","propped up","musannadatun","ۖ"],["يَحْسَبُونَ","They think","yaḥsabūna","",[["يَحْسَبُ",273],["ونَ",3]]],["كُلَّ","every","kulla",""],["صَيْحَةٍ","shout","ṣayḥatin",""],["عَلَيْهِمْ","(is) against them","ʿalayhim","ۚ",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هِمْ",3]]],["هُمُ","They","humu",""],["ٱلْعَدُوُّ","(are) the enemy","l-ʿaduwu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["عَدُوُّ",245]]],["فَٱحْذَرْهُمْ","so beware of them","fa-iḥ'dharhum","ۚ",[["فَ",7],["ٱحْذَرْ",748],["هُمْ",3]]],["قَـٰتَلَهُمُ","May destroy them","qātalahumu","",[["قَـٰتَلَ",229],["هُمُ",3]]],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah","l-lahu","ۖ"],["أَنَّىٰ","How","annā",""],["يُؤْفَكُونَ","are they deluded","yu'fakūna","",[["يُؤْفَكُ",588],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"And when it is said to them, \"Come, the Messenger of Allāh will ask forgiveness for you,\" they turn their heads aside and you see them evading while they are arrogant.","w":[["وَإِذَا","And when","wa-idhā","",[["وَ",1],["إِذَا",36]]],["قِيلَ","it is said","qīla",""],["لَهُمْ","to them","lahum","",[["لَ",8],["هُمْ",3]]],["تَعَالَوْا۟","Come","taʿālaw","",[["تَعَالَ",961],["وْا۟",4]]],["يَسْتَغْفِرْ","will ask forgiveness","yastaghfir",""],["لَكُمْ","for you","lakum","",[["لَ",8],["كُمْ",4]]],["رَسُولُ","(the) Messenger","rasūlu",""],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah","l-lahi",""],["لَوَّوْا۟","They turn aside","lawwaw","",[["لَوَّ",4098],["وْا۟",3]]],["رُءُوسَهُمْ","their heads","ruūsahum","",[["رُءُوسَ",547],["هُمْ",3]]],["وَرَأَيْتَهُمْ","and you see them","wara-aytahum","",[["وَ",1],["رَأَيْ",60],["تَ",18],["هُمْ",3]]],["يَصُدُّونَ","turning away","yaṣuddūna","",[["يَصُدُّ",328],["ونَ",3]]],["وَهُم","while they","wahum","",[["وَ",1],["هُم",3]]],["مُّسْتَكْبِرُونَ","(are) arrogant","mus'takbirūna",""]]},{"t":"It is all the same for them whether you ask forgiveness for them or do not ask forgiveness for them; never will Allāh forgive them. Indeed, Allāh does not guide the defiantly disobedient people.","w":[["سَوَآءٌ","(It) is same","sawāon",""],["عَلَيْهِمْ","for them","ʿalayhim","",[["عَلَيْ",19],["هِمْ",3]]],["أَسْتَغْفَرْتَ","whether you ask forgiveness","astaghfarta","",[["أَ",31],["سْتَغْفَرْ",299],["تَ",18]]],["لَهُمْ","for them","lahum","",[["لَ",8],["هُمْ",3]]],["أَمْ","or","am",""],["لَمْ","(do) not","lam",""],["تَسْتَغْفِرْ","ask forgiveness","tastaghfir",""],["لَهُمْ","for them","lahum","",[["لَ",8],["هُمْ",3]]],["لَن","Never","lan",""],["يَغْفِرَ","will forgive","yaghfira",""],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah","l-lahu",""],["لَهُمْ","[to] them","lahum","ۚ",[["لَ",8],["هُمْ",3]]],["إِنَّ","Indeed","inna",""],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah","l-laha",""],["لَا","(does) not","lā",""],["يَهْدِى","guide","yahdī",""],["ٱلْقَوْمَ","the people","l-qawma","",[["ٱلْ",2],["قَوْمَ",38]]],["ٱلْفَـٰسِقِينَ","the defiantly disobedient","l-fāsiqīna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["فَـٰسِقِينَ",329]]]]},{"t":"They are the ones who say, \"Do not spend on those who are with the Messenger of Allāh until they disband.\" And to Allāh belong the depositories of the heavens and the earth, but the hypocrites do not understand.","w":[["هُمُ","They","humu",""],["ٱلَّذِينَ","(are) those who","alladhīna",""],["يَقُولُونَ","say","yaqūlūna","",[["يَقُولُ",16],["ونَ",3]]],["لَا","(Do) not","lā",""],["تُنفِقُوا۟","spend","tunfiqū","",[["تُنفِقُ",190],["وا۟",4]]],["عَلَىٰ","on","ʿalā",""],["مَنْ","(those) who","man",""],["عِندَ","(are) with","ʿinda",""],["رَسُولِ","(the) Messenger","rasūli",""],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah","l-lahi",""],["حَتَّىٰ","until","ḥattā",""],["يَنفَضُّوا۟","they disband","yanfaḍḍū","ۗ",[["يَنفَضُّ",1750],["وا۟",3]]],["وَلِلَّهِ","And for Allah","walillahi","",[["وَ",1],["لِ",8],["لَّهِ",9]]],["خَزَآئِنُ","(are the) treasures","khazāinu",""],["ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","(of) the heavens","l-samāwāti","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّمَـٰوَٰتِ",49]]],["وَٱلْأَرْضِ","and the earth","wal-arḍi","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضِ",35]]],["وَلَـٰكِنَّ","but","walākinna","",[["وَ",1],["لَـٰكِنَّ",107]]],["ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ","the hypocrites","l-munāfiqīna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مُنَـٰفِقِينَ",413]]],["لَا","(do) not","lā",""],["يَفْقَهُونَ","understand","yafqahūna","",[["يَفْقَهُ",532],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"They say, \"If we return to al-Madīnah, the more honored [for power] will surely expel therefrom the more humble.\" And to Allāh belongs [all] honor, and to His Messenger, and to the believers, but the hypocrites do not know.","w":[["يَقُولُونَ","They say","yaqūlūna","",[["يَقُولُ",16],["ونَ",3]]],["لَئِن","If","la-in","",[["لَ",23],["ئِن",27]]],["رَّجَعْنَآ","we return","rajaʿnā","",[["رَّجَعْ",157],["نَآ",11]]],["إِلَى","to","ilā",""],["ٱلْمَدِينَةِ","Al-Madinah","l-madīnati","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مَدِينَةِ",664]]],["لَيُخْرِجَنَّ","surely, will expel","layukh'rijanna","",[["لَ",23],["يُخْرِجَ",131],["نَّ",0]]],["ٱلْأَعَزُّ","the more honorable","l-aʿazu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَعَزُّ",1711]]],["مِنْهَا","from it","min'hā","",[["مِنْ",6],["هَا",22]]],["ٱلْأَذَلَّ","the more humble","l-adhala","ۚ",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَذَلَّ",2114]]],["وَلِلَّهِ","But for Allah","walillahi","",[["وَ",1],["لِ",8],["لَّهِ",9]]],["ٱلْعِزَّةُ","(is) the honor","l-ʿizatu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["عِزَّةُ",779]]],["وَلِرَسُولِهِۦ","and for His Messenger","walirasūlihi","",[["وَ",1],["لِ",8],["رَسُولِ",47],["هِۦ",5]]],["وَلِلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","and for the believers","walil'mu'minīna","",[["وَ",1],["لِ",8],["لْ",2],["مُؤْمِنِينَ",70]]],["وَلَـٰكِنَّ","but","walākinna","",[["وَ",1],["لَـٰكِنَّ",107]]],["ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ","the hypocrites","l-munāfiqīna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مُنَـٰفِقِينَ",413]]],["لَا","(do) not","lā",""],["يَعْلَمُونَ","know","yaʿlamūna","",[["يَعْلَمُ",40],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"O you who have believed, let not your wealth and your children divert you from the remembrance of Allāh. And whoever does that - then those are the losers.","w":[["يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","O","yāayyuhā","",[["يَ",42],["ـٰٓأَيُّ",71],["هَا",0]]],["ٱلَّذِينَ","you (who)","alladhīna",""],["ءَامَنُوا۟","believe","āmanū","",[["ءَامَنُ",30],["وا۟",3]]],["لَا","(Let) not","lā",""],["تُلْهِكُمْ","divert you","tul'hikum","",[["تُلْهِ",1461],["كُمْ",4]]],["أَمْوَٰلُكُمْ","your wealth","amwālukum","",[["أَمْوَٰلُ",145],["كُمْ",4]]],["وَلَآ","and not","walā","",[["وَ",1],["لَآ",13]]],["أَوْلَـٰدُكُمْ","your children","awlādukum","",[["أَوْلَـٰدُ",223],["كُمْ",4]]],["عَن","from","ʿan",""],["ذِكْرِ","(the) remembrance","dhik'ri",""],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah","l-lahi","ۚ"],["وَمَن","And whoever","waman","",[["وَ",1],["مَن",25]]],["يَفْعَلْ","does","yafʿal",""],["ذَٰلِكَ","that","dhālika","",[["ذَٰ",32],["لِ",0],["كَ",0]]],["فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","then those","fa-ulāika","",[["فَ",7],["أُو۟لَـٰٓئِ",72],["كَ",0]]],["هُمُ","[they]","humu",""],["ٱلْخَـٰسِرُونَ","(are) the losers","l-khāsirūna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["خَـٰسِرُونَ",361]]]]},{"t":"And spend [in the way of Allāh] from what We have provided you before death approaches one of you and he says, \"My Lord, if only You would delay me for a brief term so I would give charity and be of the righteous.\"","w":[["وَأَنفِقُوا۟","And spend","wa-anfiqū","",[["وَ",1],["أَنفِقُ",190],["وا۟",4]]],["مِن","from","min",""],["مَّا","what","mā",""],["رَزَقْنَـٰكُم","We have provided you","razaqnākum","",[["رَزَقْ",204],["نَ",11],["ـٰكُم",4]]],["مِّن","from","min",""],["قَبْلِ","before","qabli",""],["أَن","[that]","an",""],["يَأْتِىَ","comes","yatiya",""],["أَحَدَكُمُ","(to) one of you","aḥadakumu","",[["أَحَدَ",170],["كُمُ",4]]],["ٱلْمَوْتُ","the death","l-mawtu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مَوْتُ",246]]],["فَيَقُولَ","and he says","fayaqūla","",[["فَ",7],["يَقُولَ",16]]],["رَبِّ","My Lord","rabbi","",[["رَبِّ",24],["",20]]],["لَوْلَآ","Why not","lawlā",""],["أَخَّرْتَنِىٓ","You delay me","akhartanī","",[["أَخَّرْ",610],["تَ",18],["نِىٓ",20]]],["إِلَىٰٓ","for","ilā",""],["أَجَلٍۢ","a term","ajalin",""],["قَرِيبٍۢ","near","qarībin",""],["فَأَصَّدَّقَ","so I would give charity","fa-aṣṣaddaqa","",[["فَ",7],["أَصَّدَّقَ",1149]]],["وَأَكُن","and be","wa-akun","",[["وَ",1],["أَكُن",21]]],["مِّنَ","among","mina",""],["ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","the righteous","l-ṣāliḥīna","",[["ٱل",2],["صَّـٰلِحِينَ",102]]]]},{"t":"But never will Allāh delay a soul when its time has come. And Allāh is Aware of what you do.","w":[["وَلَن","But never","walan","",[["وَ",1],["لَن",126]]],["يُؤَخِّرَ","will (be) delayed","yu-akhira",""],["ٱللَّهُ","(by) Allah","l-lahu",""],["نَفْسًا","a soul","nafsan",""